This is the pattern source, not an active project.

When working here:
- Editing CLAUDE.md or lefthook.yml means you're changing what every future
  repo gets. Think fleet-wide before committing.
- Placeholder files (readme_AI.{{AI}}ai, etc.) stay templated — init-project.sh
  expands them. Keep {{AI}} / {{HUMAN}} unexpanded.
- stacks/ contains opt-in language packs; changes there only affect repos that
  explicitly pull the stack at init or during a manual substrate update.
